{
  "id": "chapter-18",
  "title": "第十八章   为什么，要慢下来？",
  "source": {
    "file": "慢下来Apple.docx",
    "format": "docx",
    "sha256": "c0424e8c16eb400c5c142a7a9b7941535e404e5a3604d45e19059def8df2466c"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "第十八章   为什么，要慢下来？",
      "sourceParagraph": 607,
      "sourceStyle": "Heading 1",
      "anchor": "heading-607"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "当时间不再被压缩，世界才逐渐显露出它原本的样子。",
      "sourceParagraph": 608,
      "sourceStyle": "入口句"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——回到最初的问题",
      "sourceParagraph": 610,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "当我们谈论慢门，谈论技术、历史、城市、自然、情绪、记忆与当下，最终仍会回到一个看似简单的问题：",
      "sourceParagraph": 611,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "为什么，要慢下来？",
      "sourceParagraph": 612,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这个问题，并不是摄影提出的。它来自生活本身。",
      "sourceParagraph": 613,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "一、慢下来，并不是因为时间不够",
      "sourceParagraph": 614,
      "sourceStyle": "Heading 3",
      "anchor": "heading-614"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "人们常以为，慢下来是因为有余裕，是奢侈的选择。",
      "sourceParagraph": 615,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "但事实恰恰相反。我们之所以需要慢下来，正是因为时间正在被不断压缩、消耗、替换。",
      "sourceParagraph": 616,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "当一切都要求迅速完成，经验便失去了展开的空间。",
      "sourceParagraph": 617,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我们看见了很多，却记住得很少。",
      "sourceParagraph": 618,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "慢门摄影提醒我们：时间不是敌人，被忽略才是。",
      "sourceParagraph": 619,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "二、慢门不是对抗，而是回归",
      "sourceParagraph": 620,
      "sourceStyle": "Heading 3",
      "anchor": "heading-620"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "慢门并不是对速度的否定，也不是对现代生活的抗拒。",
      "sourceParagraph": 621,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "assets/books/slow-down-docx/photo-23-reading.jpg",
      "fullSrc": "assets/books/slow-down-docx/photo-23-large.jpg",
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 799,
      "alt": "当速度被放慢，城市不再喧哗，只剩光在流动。",
      "caption": "当速度被放慢，城市不再喧哗，只剩光在流动。",
      "sourceParagraph": 621,
      "sourceImage": "VictoriaHaborHK6Web.JPG"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "它只是让我们回到一个更接近自身经验的节奏。",
      "sourceParagraph": 622,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在慢门中，我们重新学习如何等待，如何停留，如何让变化自然发生。",
      "sourceParagraph": 623,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这并不是倒退，而是一种回归——回到感知本身。",
      "sourceParagraph": 624,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "三、慢门让摄影重新变得谦逊",
      "sourceParagraph": 625,
      "sourceStyle": "Heading 3",
      "anchor": "heading-625"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在慢门摄影中，摄影不再是占有现实的工具，而是一种参与现实的方式。",
      "sourceParagraph": 626,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "摄影者不再试图“抓住”世界，而是允许世界在时间中展开。",
      "sourceParagraph": 627,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这种姿态，让摄影重新变得谦逊。它不追求控制，也不急于证明。",
      "sourceParagraph": 628,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "慢门并不要求完美，它只要求诚实。",
      "sourceParagraph": 629,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "四、当影像退后，经验走向前",
      "sourceParagraph": 630,
      "sourceStyle": "Heading 3",
      "anchor": "heading-630"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "慢门最终并不是关于影像本身。影像只是结果。",
      "sourceParagraph": 631,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "真正发生变化的，是摄影者与世界之间的关系。",
      "sourceParagraph": 632,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "当影像不再是目标，经验便重新走向前台。你开始记住风的方向，记住光线的变化，记住某一刻的停留。",
      "sourceParagraph": 633,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这些记忆，并不一定被拍下来，却真实地存在过。",
      "sourceParagraph": 634,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "assets/books/slow-down-docx/photo-24-reading.jpg",
      "fullSrc": "assets/books/slow-down-docx/photo-24-large.jpg",
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 933,
      "alt": "有些风景，不属于瞬间，它们只在时间里显现。",
      "caption": "有些风景，不属于瞬间，它们只在时间里显现。",
      "sourceParagraph": 634,
      "sourceImage": "YosemiteCreeks2B.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "五、慢门之后，仍然是生活",
      "sourceParagraph": 635,
      "sourceStyle": "Heading 3",
      "anchor": "heading-635"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "慢门并不会改变世界的速度。世界依旧运转，时间依旧前行。慢门所改变的，只是我们与这一切相处的方式。",
      "sourceParagraph": 636,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在该快的时候快，在可以慢的时候慢。",
      "sourceParagraph": 637,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "慢门不是答案，而是一种选择的可能。",
      "sourceParagraph": 638,
      "sourceStyle": "Body"
    }
  ]
}
